  m_text: Here you can exchange crafted goods for valuable Pearls, purchase essential
    raw materials, and hire specialized personnel. The local economy is highly volatile;
    item values fluctuate every day based on supply, demand, and unpredictable World
    Events. To amass true wealth, you must watch the market closely, weather sudden
    crashes, and time your trades perfectly to capitalize on lucrative economic booms.
